  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DCM Yapi Kredi DPR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will increase access to finance for MSMEs with part of the funding earmarked for WMSMEs and part for climate, thus helping promote economic growth, increased employment, &amp; generation of higher income. IFCs support will also enable YKB to increase its green finance portfolio, leading to GHG emissions savings and creating a strong demonstration effect for other Turkish banks.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims to provide financing of up to US$125 million from IFCs own account to Yapi Kredi (YKB or the Bank) through an investment in the Banks Diversified Payment Rights (DPR) notes. The proceeds of IFCs investment will enable the Bank to continue supporting Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises (MSME) in T&#xfc;rkiye, with a portion earmarked for women-owned MSMEs (WMSMEs) and a portion for climate finance for MSMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
